    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"comm lag\" sounds a bit vague. I'm seeing some noise in the diagnostic logs for the X-2s, specifically regarding the sensor suite. Is that part of the lag you're seeing? Just want to make sure we aren't looking at a hardware issue that might sideline a bunch of cars mid-shift.",
